"Specifies the time (in seconds) until idle clients should be closed with a "
"GOAWAY frame. PING frames are not considered as activity."
msgstr ""
"指定闲置客户端应在多长时间（单位：秒）内使用 GOAWAY 帧关闭。PING 帧不被视为活"
"动。"

